          "q": "Find the vector projection of $\\mathbf{u} = \\langle 6, 2 \\rangle$ onto $\\mathbf{v} = \\langle 3, 0 \\rangle$.",
          "answer": "$\\mathrm{proj}_{\\mathbf{v}}\\mathbf{u} = \\frac{\\mathbf{u}\\cdot\\mathbf{v}}{|\\mathbf{v}|^2}\\mathbf{v} = \\frac{18}{9}\\langle 3, 0 \\rangle = \\langle 6, 0 \\rangle$."
